# Every text file is LF in the working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says: the builder
# writes README.md with LF and refuses to touch a CRLF copy, and the scripts run under
# bash. Pinned here rather than left to the checkout machine.
*       text=auto eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
